Subject: [PATCH 2/6] fix(gateway): make DSoftBus bridging teardown safe

Make the DSoftBus-only OpenHarmony profile fail closed and add runtime health instrumentation.

Use two-phase bridge activation, RAII endpoint ownership and guarded spin-thread shutdown to make construction and teardown exception safe.

Add configuration and runtime-health tests and update the gateway design contract.
