From 536b848a604993096e17ba2181088170853b7e26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peng Yusheng <jiusi0519@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 00:48:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] fix(gateway): fail closed on delivery and shutdown faults

Fence reverse Cyclone-to-MDDS delivery with bounded ACK/history state and
fail closed on bridge errors. Make construction and teardown callback-safe.

Replace the unbounded executor spin with a bounded polling loop. The new
no-throw guard joins even when Executor::cancel() fails, reports that failure
on the explicit shutdown path, and is covered by injected throwing-wakeup
tests.
---
 mdds_gateway/CMakeLists.txt                  |  13 +
 mdds_gateway/docs/design.md                  |  91 ++++-
